WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:02.825
Unit one. Food Groups!

2
00:00:03.775 --> 00:00:07.282
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.332 --> 00:00:10.707
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:10.757 --> 00:00:14.119
Today we learn about Food Groups. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.126 --> 00:00:18.443
Grain. Say it with me. Grain!

6
00:00:21.946 --> 00:00:25.496
Protein. Say it with me. Protein!

7
00:00:28.982 --> 00:00:32.182
Dairy. Say it with me. Dairy!

8
00:00:35.679 --> 00:00:39.313
Fruit group. Say it with me. Fruit group!

9
00:00:42.814 --> 00:00:46.847
Vegetable group. Say it with me. Vegetable group!

10
00:00:50.369 --> 00:00:54.102
Balanced. Say it with me. Balanced!

11
00:00:57.599 --> 00:01:01.232
Portion. Say it with me. Portion!

12
00:01:04.735 --> 00:01:08.235
Energy. Say it with me. Energy!

13
00:01:11.735 --> 00:01:20.784
A balanced meal includes grain, protein, dairy, and the fruit and vegetable groups. Eating the right portion of each group gives my body energy to learn and play.

14
00:01:20.834 --> 00:01:22.034
I can do that too!

15
00:01:23.462 --> 00:01:28.756
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:28.806 --> 00:01:29.956
Dairy!

17
00:01:30.923 --> 00:01:36.142
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.192 --> 00:01:37.342
Portion!

19
00:01:38.222 --> 00:01:44.938
Did you know? Beans and eggs are both great sources of protein, which helps build strong muscles!

20
00:01:44.988 --> 00:01:46.934
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.618 --> 00:01:55.312
Think and answer. What food groups did you eat today?

22
00:01:55.362 --> 00:01:56.512
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.853 --> 00:02:02.728
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.778 --> 00:02:05.583
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

